SCOPE: This MIT license covers the SOURCE CODE of Commander In Chief (GDScript
under src/, tools/, tests/, and project configuration). It does NOT grant any
rights to the bundled art, audio, or other assets, which carry their own
separate terms. See ASSETS.md for a complete per-directory provenance and
licensing map, and ASSETS.md for the outstanding release
blockers.

As of 2026-07-24 every IMAGE in this repository is either owned by the project
(procedurally generated by tools/gen_*.py, or generative-AI art commissioned by
the project) or CC0 (assets/cc0/, assets/fonts/). The previously bundled
the earlier art and infantry set art has been removed from the working tree.

The bundled AUDIO under assets/vo/ and assets/audio/ is synthesized speech
generated for this project. It is documented in ASSETS.md rather than granted by
this file.

The earlier third-party art was removed from the working tree AND
purged from git history on 2026-07-27 (tools/purge_history.sh), which is what
allowed this repository to be published. Clones made before that date are on
rewritten history and must be re-cloned.
